WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.620 --> 00:00:13.901
Biggs, the Miners' coach, stomped onto the field.

2
00:00:14.621 --> 00:00:16.442
The Loggers' coach ran onto the field too.

3
00:00:17.442 --> 00:00:18.823
"Let my players go, Hitz!"

4
00:00:19.123 --> 00:00:19.883
Coach Biggs said.

5
00:00:19.903 --> 00:00:21.464
"And then get out of here!

6
00:00:22.024 --> 00:00:23.665
You're a cheater and a bad sport!"

7
00:00:24.725 --> 00:00:26.186
Fitz Hitz puffed out his chest.

8
00:00:26.206 --> 00:00:27.906
"I'm a winner!"

9
00:00:27.926 --> 00:00:30.727
"I have to arrest Fitz Hitz!"

10
00:00:31.068 --> 00:00:31.728
Roxy thought.

11
00:00:32.548 --> 00:00:33.669
She started to fly down.

12
00:00:34.650 --> 00:00:36.892
But then she heard fans yelling at Coach Biggs.

13
00:00:42.177 --> 00:00:43.558
Hitz play, Coach!"

14
00:00:44.058 --> 00:00:44.879
a fan shouted.

15
00:00:45.459 --> 00:00:46.921
She wore a Miners baseball cap.

16
00:00:46.941 --> 00:00:49.763
"Yeah!" Another fan said.

17
00:00:50.364 --> 00:00:52.245
His face was painted with the Miners' colors.

18
00:00:52.265 --> 00:00:54.887
"You shouldn't have kicked Hitz off the team!"

19
00:00:55.788 --> 00:00:56.569
Fans chanted.

20
00:00:56.589 --> 00:00:58.290
"Let Hitz play!

21
00:00:58.731 --> 00:00:59.932
Let Hitz play!"

22
00:01:03.116 --> 00:01:04.837
Coach Biggs threw his hands in the air.

23
00:01:04.857 --> 00:01:07.937
"Fine!" He stomped off the field.

24
00:01:09.818 --> 00:01:11.078
The Loggers' coach shrugged.

25
00:01:11.978 --> 00:01:14.419
"You want to finish the game with just one player?

26
00:01:15.019 --> 00:01:17.460
Fine! We're already winning anyway."

27
00:01:18.880 --> 00:01:20.041
Hitz stepped up to the plate.

28
00:01:21.501 --> 00:01:23.041
Sparks shot from his Blast Bat.

29
00:01:24.122 --> 00:01:25.682
The Loggers' pitcher threw the ball.

30
00:01:27.023 --> 00:01:27.603
Hitz swung.

31
00:01:28.623 --> 00:01:31.984
Crack—pow! The ball shot through the air like a meteor.

32
00:01:35.412 --> 00:01:36.573
Roxy's eyes went wide.

33
00:01:36.593 --> 00:01:38.994
"That's a powerful bat!"

34
00:01:40.095 --> 00:01:41.796
"Home run!"

35
00:01:41.996 --> 00:01:42.796
the announcer said.

36
00:01:42.816 --> 00:01:46.278
"Yeah! A home run for me!"

37
00:01:48.499 --> 00:01:50.941
Hitz cheered for himself as he ran around the bases.

38
00:01:53.202 --> 00:01:54.483
He stepped up to the plate again.

39
00:01:57.484 --> 00:02:00.566
Crack—pow! The ball smashed a big screen.

40
00:02:01.466 --> 00:02:02.307
Roxy gasped.

41
00:02:03.107 --> 00:02:04.228
But the crowd cheered.

42
00:02:08.268 --> 00:02:09.489
"Another home run for the Miners!"

43
00:02:09.769 --> 00:02:10.570
the announcer said.

44
00:02:11.251 --> 00:02:14.053
Crack—pow! Hitz hit the ball again.

45
00:02:14.914 --> 00:02:16.635
It shot into the stands and broke a beam.

46
00:02:17.196 --> 00:02:19.277
An entire section of seats began to fall.

47
00:02:20.779 --> 00:02:21.740
Fans screamed.

48
00:02:26.223 --> 00:02:26.924
Roxy thought.

49
00:02:29.206 --> 00:02:30.867
Her friends were under the broken section!

50
00:02:30.887 --> 00:02:33.369
"We'll be crushed!"

51
00:02:33.730 --> 00:02:34.430
Mara cried.

52
00:02:35.031 --> 00:02:35.972
Roxy flew fast.

53
00:02:40.344 --> 00:02:42.566
She got under the broken section and lifted it back up.

54
00:02:44.527 --> 00:02:46.268
She used her heat vision to fix the beam.

55
00:02:49.571 --> 00:02:50.471
The crowd cheered.

56
00:02:55.995 --> 00:02:56.736
Terrell grinned.

57
00:02:56.756 --> 00:02:58.697
"Thanks, Rocket Girl!"

58
00:02:58.717 --> 00:03:00.558
"No problem!"

59
00:03:01.039 --> 00:03:01.859
Roxy smiled.

60
00:03:02.660 --> 00:03:03.961
Then she flew over the field.

61
00:03:03.981 --> 00:03:07.123
"Game over, Fitz!

62
00:03:07.483 --> 00:03:08.644
You're under arrest!"

63
00:03:10.200 --> 00:03:12.021
Fitz Hitz had an evil look in his eye.

64
00:03:12.862 --> 00:03:15.363
"I don't think so, Rocket Girl."

65
00:03:16.143 --> 00:03:16.984
He picked up a ball.

66
00:03:18.945 --> 00:03:21.506
Crack—pow! It shot toward Roxy.

67
00:03:21.526 --> 00:03:24.868
"Whoa!" Roxy barely got out of the way in time.

68
00:03:26.189 --> 00:03:27.190
A jet was flying by.

69
00:03:28.070 --> 00:03:29.631
The ball broke one of its wings.

70
00:03:31.652 --> 00:03:36.035
The crowd gasped as the jet spun downward.

71
00:03:37.175 --> 00:03:38.116
Fitz Hitz shrugged.

72
00:03:39.189 --> 00:03:41.296
"Another home run for me!"
